;
; How Gnomon files a saved figure, in MYRA (gnomon_rules.h GR5): the
; figure's number, how many vertices it holds, its kind (0 a polygon drawn
; point by point, 1 a turtle path) and when it was saved (Unix seconds).
; Gnomon asks whether the numbers fit before it lists them.
^ZXGNOMON(figure:i9) = vertices:i4! ^ kind:i1! ^ mtime:i12!
